## Soko Safi Backend Environment Example
## Copy to `.env` and fill in values.

## --- Gmail SMTP (transactional email) ---
## Use a dedicated Gmail inbox + App Password (requires 2-Step Verification).
SMTP_ENABLED=false
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=your_gmail_address@gmail.com
SMTP_PASS=your_gmail_app_password
SMTP_FROM_NAME=Soko Safi
## Optional (defaults to SMTP_USER)
# SMTP_FROM_EMAIL=your_gmail_address@gmail.com

## --- Email notification throttling ---
## Minimum minutes between email notifications per (conversation, recipient).
CHAT_EMAIL_THROTTLE_MINUTES=15

